### 4.1 Predefined Combinations

| Task Type | Primary | Secondary | Required Gates |
|-----------|---------|-----------|---------------|
| Landing/Portfolio/Greenfield | frontend-taste | full-output, frontend-review | taste-pre/post, fulloutput-pre/post, review-pre/post |
| Redesign Existing | frontend-redesign | full-output, frontend-review | redesign-pre/post, fulloutput-pre/post, review-pre/post |
| Build/Create Components | frontend-taste | full-output, frontend-review | taste-pre, fulloutput-pre, review-pre, all post |
| Code Review Only | frontend-review | (standalone) | review-pre + review-post |
| Quality Check Only | frontend-review | (standalone) | review-pre + review-post |
| Security Vulnerability | security-review | (standalone) | security-pre + security-post |
| Payment + Security | security-review | vietnam-payment-review | security-pre/post + payment-pre/post |
| Vietnam Payment Only | vietnam-payment-review | security-review (if auth) | payment-pre/post + security-pre |
| API Security | security-review | (standalone) | security-pre + security-post |
| APK/Binary RE | security-review | reverse-skill | security-pre + RE skill + security-post |
| Bazi Fortune | bazi | (standalone) | bazi-pre + bazi-post |
| Vietnam Address | vietnam-address | full-output | address-pre/post + fulloutput-pre/post |
| Knowledge Base | weknora-kb | (standalone) | weknora-pre/post |
| RAG Implementation | weknora-kb | rag + full-output | weknora-pre + rag-pre + posts |
| Visual Document | pixelrag | full-output | pixelrag-pre/post + fulloutput-pre/post |
| Visual RAG | pixelrag | weknora-kb | pixelrag-pre/post + weknora-pre/post |
| ReAct Agent | weknora-agent | weknora-kb | agent-pre + weknora-pre + posts |
| **Any coding task** | (task-specific) | karpathy-coding | karpathy-pre/post + task gates |

### 4.2 Mandatory Overlay Rule

**karpathy-coding LUÔN chạy như overlay với mọi coding task:**

```
ANY CODING TASK
     │
     ├── Primary skill selected (based on task type)
     │
     ├── Secondary skills (based on context)
     │
     └── + karpathy-coding (MANDATORY OVERLAY)
              │
              ├── Pre: K.1-K.4 (always)
              └── Post: K.5-K.7 (always)
```

**ponytail là OPTIONAL overlay:**
- Enable khi user nhắc: simple, minimal, less code, yagni
- Có thể disable với: `/ponytail off`
- Chạy SAU karpathy gates

**Karpathy + Ponytail Relationship:**

| Phase | Skill | Question |
|-------|-------|----------|
| THINK FIRST | karpathy-coding | What to build? Scope? Options? |
| MINIMIZE CODE | ponytail | How to build with least code? |

They are **complementary**:
- karpathy-coding: Prevents building **wrong things** (wrong scope, wrong direction)
- ponytail: Prevents building things **too verbosely** (too much code)

**Execution Order:**
```
karpathy-pre (MANDATORY) → [ponytail-pre if enabled] → IMPLEMENT → [ponytail-post if enabled] → karpathy-post (MANDATORY)
```

