## PHẦN 6: DECISION TREE

### 6.1 Skill Detection Flow

```
START: Request Received
│
├── Is request PAYMENT? (MoMo, SePay, PayOS, VNPay, ZaloPay, VietQR)
│   ├── YES + SECURITY? → security-review + vietnam-payment-review
│   └── YES → vietnam-payment-review + [security-review if auth]
│
├── Is request SECURITY? (vulnerability, pentest, CVE, OWASP)
│   ├── YES + APK/Binary? → security-review + reverse-skill
│   └── YES → security-review (standalone)
│
├── Is request FRONTEND? (UI, landing, redesign, component)
│   ├── REDESIGN? (existing site) → frontend-redesign + full-output + frontend-review
│   ├── BUILD? (new landing/portfolio) → frontend-taste + full-output + frontend-review
│   ├── REVIEW? → frontend-review (standalone)
│   └── OTHER? → frontend-taste + frontend-review
│
├── Is request KNOWLEDGE? (RAG, wiki, FAQ, weknora)
│   ├── AGENT? → weknora-agent + weknora-kb
│   ├── VISUAL? → pixelrag + weknora-kb
│   └── OTHER? → weknora-kb
│
├── Is request OCR? (text extraction, image to text)
│   ├── VISUAL? → pixelrag
│   └── OTHER? → document-ocr
│
└── DEFAULT
    ├── CODING TASK → [domain skill] + karpathy-coding
    └── OTHER → karpathy-coding (standalone)
```

### 6.2 Confidence-Based Selection

```
FOR EACH detected skill:
│
├── confidence >= 0.75?
│   ├── YES → AUTO-SELECT (no confirmation needed)
│   └── NO → Continue evaluation
│
├── confidence >= 0.50?
│   ├── YES → SUGGEST to user
│   └── NO → Continue
│
└── confidence < 0.40?
    └── YES → AMBIGUOUS (ask for clarification)
```

